<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Omni Media half yr shr rises, dividend up.</title>
<headline>Omni Media half yr shr rises, dividend up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended September 30 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		113	vs    86</p>
<p>    - post-excepts	  118	vs    80</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  22	vs    19</p>
<p>Income</p>
<p>    - attributable	   71.13   vs    46.80</p>
<p>    - headline		 67.86   vs    50.39</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    77.03   vs    75.00</p>
<p>    Tax			  25.21   vs    25.39</p>
