<p>    Turnover		1,012.97   vs   911.74</p>
<p>    Share of associates'   36.06   vs    14.03</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 8.50   vs     2.75</p>
<p>Div payable: January 24 1997</p>
<p>on register: January 3 1997</p>
<p>Full name: Omni Media Corp Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
